,51,51,51,51,51,51,51,51,51,51],"nar":[{"lap":0,"text":"Some 50,000 spectators turned up hoping to see a good fight between Chiron, Lehoux, and Czaykowski in their Bugattis against Etancelin and Dreyfus in their Italian cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Some 50,000 spectators turned up hoping to see a good fight between Chiron, Lehoux, and Czaykowski in their Bugattis against Etancelin and Dreyfus in their Italian cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"The whole field of 26 cars (Note 1) got away well together with Dreyfus taking the lead with his Maserati.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":1,"text":"It was also Dreyfus who first appeared at the end of the first lap but Chiron was right behind him and they passed the grand stand side by side with Chiron taking over the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":1,"text":"The whole field of 26 cars (Note 1) got away well together with Dreyfus taking the lead with his Maserati.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":1,"text":"It was also Dreyfus who first appeared at the end of the first lap but Chiron was right behind him and they passed the grand stand side by side with Chiron taking over the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":2,"text":"At the end of the second lap Chiron arrived well in the lead but approaching the finish line he put his hand in the air as a warning and pulled the Bugatti into the pit and retired with a broken drive shaft.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":2,"text":"Dreyfus was now back in the lead","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":2,"text":"At the end of the second lap Chiron arrived well in the lead but approaching the finish line he put his hand in the air as a warning and pulled the Bugatti into the pit and retired with a broken drive shaft.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":2,"text":"Dreyfus was now back in the lead","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":3,"text":"Lehoux passes Dreyfus for the lead; Czaykowski is third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Lehoux passes Dreyfus for the lead; Czaykowski is third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"Lehoux finished the sixth lap in 20m15s corresponding to a speed of 142.2 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"Lehoux finished the sixth lap in 20m15s corresponding to a speed of 142.2 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":7,"text":"But he had not been able to shake off Dreyfus, who on the seventh lap was back in the lead for a third time.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"But he had not been able to shake off Dreyfus, who on the seventh lap was back in the lead for a third time.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":10,"text":"Lehoux retakes the lead from Dreyfus.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Lehoux retakes the lead from Dreyfus.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"Gaupillat and Hell\u00e9-Nice make pit stops; in the 2 litre class Gaupillat leads de Maleplane.","q":false},{"lap":12,"text":"Gaupillat and Hell\u00e9-Nice make pit stops; in the 2 litre class Gaupillat leads de Maleplane.","q":false},{"lap":15,"text":"At 15 laps Dreyfus gave up the hope of keeping up with Lehoux, who started to pull away with some 4 seconds a lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"At 15 laps Dreyfus gave up the hope of keeping up with Lehoux, who started to pull away with some 4 seconds a lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"d'Arnoux retired to the pit with technical problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":25},{"lap":18,"text":"d'Arnoux retired to the pit with technical problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":25},{"lap":20,"text":"There were other retirements as well, especially in the voiturette class, among them Frankl.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":20,"text":"There were other retirements as well, especially in the voiturette class, among them Frankl.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":26,"text":"Lehoux sets a new lap record of 3m14s (148.5 km/h).","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":26,"text":"Lehoux sets a new lap record of 3m14s (148.5 km/h).","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Hell\u00e9-Nice stopped again and Itier made a pit stop as well.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":28,"text":"Hell\u00e9-Nice stopped again and Itier made a pit stop as well.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":30,"text":"Lehoux still held up the high speed and Dreyfus was falling further back as was Czaykowski in third position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Lehoux still held up the high speed and Dreyfus was falling further back as was Czaykowski in third position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"So Lehoux took the flag almost 2 \u00bd minutes before Dreyfus, who was the only other driver not to be lapped.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Czaykowski finished third and Etancelin fourth. The others were far behind with de Maleplane finishing fifth overall and winning the 2 litre class","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":50,"text":"Aubert was the winner of the voiturette class, taking the flag over 36 minutes after Lehoux, with Delorme second in the class and Mme. Itier third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":50,"text":"So Lehoux took the flag almost 2 \u00bd minutes before Dreyfus, who was the only other driver not to be lapped.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Czaykowski finished third and Etancelin fourth. The others were far behind with de Maleplane finishing fifth overall and winning the 2 litre class","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":50,"text":"Aubert was the winner of the voiturette class, taking the flag over 36 minutes after Lehoux, with Delorme second in the class and Mme. Itier third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7}]}